 isolated;\n- exposes controls in Settings and "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"through the `skill_manager` model tool."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Icon | Capability | Description |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| 🚀 | Proactive activation | Full skill injection for strong matches and lightweight reminders for s"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"uggestions |\n| 🪝 | Skill-level hooks | `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `PostToolUse"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"Failure`, and `SessionStart` |\n| 🔄 | GitHub lifecycle | Install, update, authoritative sync, uninsta"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ll, and commit-change reporting |\n| 🧭 | Workspace-aware scope | Project skills override user skills "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"without leaking configuration between workspaces |\n| 🛠️ | Built-in management | Settings UI plus the"},{"id":"p15s6","text":" `skill_manager` model tool |\n| 🛡️ | Guardrails | Source allowlisting, argument-array Git execution,"},{"id":"p15s7","text":" hook path validation, and no shell execution for hooks |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Before each agent step, the plugin scores available skills:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"1. explicit skill-name mention: **+12**;\n2. trigger phrase or regular expression: **+7**;\n3. descrip"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"tion or `whenToUse` token overlap: **+4 to +6**."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"By default, a turn can auto-load up to two skills and suggest up to three. Activation markers are st"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ored in conversation history, so full skill content is not injected repeatedly while it remains visi"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ble. After context compaction removes a marker, the skill can be loaded again automatically."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.2`, `0.1.2-alpha.3`, `0.1.3-alpha.1`, `0.2.0-rc.2`, `0.2.1-rc.2`, `0.2."},{"id":"p22s2","text":"1-rc.3`, or `0.2.1-rc.5`.\n- Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0`;\n- pnpm available on `PATH` for `dsh plug"},{"id":"p22s3","text":".3`, or `0.2.1-rc.5`.\n- Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0`;\n- pnpm available on `PATH` for `dsh plugin`."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Component | Supported or continuously verified |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| DeepSeek Harness | `0.1.1-rc.2` dependency contract; `0.1.2-alpha.3` dependency contract plus isol"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ated install and UI smoke tests; `0.1.3-alpha.1` tagged-source API review and session-hook regressio"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"n tests; `0.2.0-rc.2` isolated install, Web boot, Settings API, and live `/name` skill invocation |\n"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"| DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1` | `0.2.1-rc.2` and `0.2.1-rc.3`: isolated installation, composed configur"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"ation, Web startup, Settings API and UI, and 14 host regression tests per version |\n| DeepSeek Harne"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"ss `0.2.1-rc.5` | Linux and Node.js `24.22.2`: 51 tests, compatibility admission, isolated configura"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"tion, Web startup, Settings API and UI, and browser bundle delivery |\n| Node.js | `22.19.0` and `24."},{"id":"p25s8","text":"19.0` |\n| pnpm | `11.19.0` with a frozen lockfile |\n| Operating systems | Ubuntu and Windows CI matr"},{"id":"p25s9","text":"` |\n| pnpm | `11.19.0` with a frozen lockfile |\n| Operating systems | Ubuntu and Windows CI matrix |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The `0.1.3-alpha.1` adaptation supports `session.snapshotEvents()` and array-based surface nodes whi"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"le retaining the legacy events API. Full install/UI smoke testing for that release is pending availa"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"bility of its host packages on npm."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"For DSH `0.2.0-rc.2`, use plugin `1.0.6` or later. Older versions emit `source.kind: \"plugin\"`, whic"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"h DSH's v4 session format rejects. A live Web profile test invoked `/ponytail-help` and loaded its f"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ull instructions (`skill-invocation`). The test recorded the manager notice as `plugin:dsh-skills-ma"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"nager` and completed the turn."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For DSH `0.2.1-rc.2` or `0.2.1-rc.3`, use plugin `1.0.7` or later. Skill activation, project overrid"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"es, tool status, and hook payloads follow the current session directory. Each scope's hook cache ref"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"reshes when that directory changes. Older hosts continue to use `session.header.cwd`."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"For DSH `0.2.1-rc.5`, use plugin `1.0.8` or later. Version `1.0.7` omits this runtime from its compa"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"tibility declaration, so DSH denies activation."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The `engines.dsh` declaration and host peer dependencies specify the same supported versions. Other "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"`0.2.x` versions remain outside that range."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Hook compatibility"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Skill hook | DSH host event | Support |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| `UserPromptSubmit` | `agent/pre-step` | ✅ Inject text on every submission while active |\n| `PreToo"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"lUse` | `tools/pre-execute` | ✅ Allow, deny, or ask based on tool and arguments |\n| `PostToolUse` | "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"`tools/post-execute` | ✅ Activate a skill from matching tool output |\n| `PostToolUseFailure` | `tool"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"s/post-execute` | ✅ Match failure text through the same result event |\n| `SessionStart` | `agent/ses"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"sion-start` | ✅ Activate before matching is required |\n| `SessionEnd` / `Stop` | `agent/disposed` / "},{"id":"p34s6","text":"`agent/turn-stopping` | ⚠️ Observable only; no content injection |\n| `PreCompact` | No DSH core equi"},{"id":"p34s7","text":"valent | ⚠️ Not implemented; removed activation markers allow reinjection |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- Git sources must match the supported URL allowlist.\n- Git arguments are passed as arrays, not inte"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"rpolated shell commands.\n- Skill hooks do not run through a shell.\n- Manifest hook paths must resolv"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"e to Node scripts inside the cloned repository.\n- Malformed regular expressions and unsupported hook"},{"id":"p36s4","text":" declarations are ignored."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Installing a plugin with executable hooks means trusting that repository's code. Review third-party "},{"id":"p37s2","text":"sources before installation."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"See SECURITY.md for supported versions and private vulnerability reporting."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

